5,1,1,talk,George,,We need a system that doesn't make us resent each other. I suggest we look into what other households do and our own past friction.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. I want to see the hours of use in the diary and the trial of recording every run to see the overhead.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I'm more concerned with the car's condition and reliability. I'll check the state at handover and the repeating weekly trips.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"We need to know who is subsidizing whom. I'll look at the fuel receipts and the tax, insurance, and parking papers.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to know the real figures. I'll check the fuel receipts too, and the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, do you think the diary will show why we clash, or just when?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It shows the demand. I think the recording trial will show the effort required to be ""fair.""","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, will the papers tell us if the maintenance is being handled fairly?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"Maybe not the maintenance, but the fixed costs. We need a baseline.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I just want us to be honest with each other about the money.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
