31,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,George,,"Other groups say asking favors is the poison. Also, our own attempt at checking figures created a lot of tension.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The diary shows huge spikes in demand on weekends. Plus, recording every single run takes a surprising amount of time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"It's worse than I thought. Some people leave the car dirty or empty, and our regular weekly trips are the ones failing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fuel spending is completely lopsided. A few people pay for almost everything, while others pay nothing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I saw the fuel imbalance too. And George is right; when we tried to be precise with figures, we just ended up arguing.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"So, precision might actually hurt our friendship. We need a system that reduces the need to ask for favors.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"If recording runs takes an hour a week, we can't do that. It's too much administrative waste.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, if the fuel is that uneven, we can't keep the ""equal share"" idea. But we need reliability for those weekly trips.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,Exactly. An even split of costs isn't fair if the usage is this skewed. We need a way to tie cost to use.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"But if checking figures makes us feel accused, how do we track use without fighting?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"Maybe we avoid the ""checking"" part by having a set rule that doesn't require constant auditing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,A fixed system would eliminate the need for those long evenings of arranging and untangling.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I just want to know the car will be there and clean on my mornings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Toshio. A structured system prevents the ""quiet subsidy"" I'm worried about.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I agree, as long as the system is transparent and doesn't feel like a police investigation.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
