60,3,1,talk,George,,Option A is too much auditing. Option B is stable. Option C puts the burden on one person. I prefer B.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,A is an administrative nightmare. C is too informal. B is the most efficient for my time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,B guarantees my mornings. I don't have to hope it's there or ask for a favor. I vote B.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"B is simple, but A is the only one that's truly fair for fuel. However, A might cause the fighting George mentioned.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,"A seems the most honest, but I don't want us to be unhappy. B seems peaceful.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, if A leads to the ""checking figures"" tension we saw before, it's not worth the mathematical fairness.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,Exactly. The mental energy of Option A is a hidden cost we can't afford.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Minato, do you think B is fair enough if we just accept the fixed cost?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"If we go with B, some people will still subsidize others, but it stops the daily friction.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,I think I can accept that if it keeps us all friends.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,George,,"I'm sticking with B. It removes the ""favor"" dynamic entirely.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,B is my choice. No more untangling hours of scheduling.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,B for me. Reliability over everything.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'll vote B. It's better to have a predictable system than a ""fair"" one that makes us fight.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'll vote B too. Let's keep things peaceful.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
